Popna Universal Business Management Platform
Transform Popna from ISP/cable-focused SaaS into a universal business management platform serving every industry (pharmacy, supermarket, restaurant, salon, clinic, gym, etc.). Add ~9 new modules, industry template system, enhance existing modules, and ensure excellent mobile UX with dark mode and i18n support.

User Review Required
IMPORTANT

This is a very large implementation (~40 new files, ~15 modified files, ~10,000+ lines of code). I recommend implementing in phases, starting each phase and verifying before moving to the next. Each phase produces a working, verifiable state.

WARNING

The existing signup flow in 
Login.tsx
 currently uses a simple BUSINESS_TYPES string array. We will enhance this with a styled industry card grid tied to the new industry template system. The old dropdown will be replaced.

