Verification Plan
Automated Tests
No test framework currently exists in the project. Verification will be done via build checks and browser testing.

bash
# After each phase, verify the app compiles
cd d:\React\popna\popna-entertainment
npm run dev
Manual Verification (User)
Build check: Run npm run dev after each phase → app should start without TypeScript or runtime errors
Module CRUD: Navigate to each new module page (Expenses, Quotations, etc.) → create, edit, delete a record → verify DataTable renders correctly
Industry templates: Click "Sign Up" on login page → verify industry card grid appears → select an industry → verify form submits
Dark mode: Toggle theme on every new page → verify no hardcoded colors, all components use dark: variants
Mobile (375px): Resize browser to 375px width → verify all pages are usable, cards stack full-width, bottom nav works, POS has touch-friendly targets
i18n: Switch language to any supported language → verify no raw 
t()
 keys shown (all have English fallback)
Sidebar filtering: Verify new modules appear in sidebar only when allowed by org's allowedModules
POS enhancements: Test hold bill → retrieve bill flow, payment methods
Reports: Navigate to Reports page → verify charts render with Recharts, CSV export works
Audit Trail: Navigate to Audit Trail → verify activity log displays entries
